<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, backgroundColor: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', padding: 0, flexDirection: 'column' }}>

  <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 72, background: '#1E4FA8', paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 8, height: 36, background: '#3D7BD9' }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>参考文献</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#B9CCEA' }}>References</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 598, paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, paddingTop: 24, flexDirection: 'column' }}>

    {[
      '[1]', 'B. Kerbl, G. Kopanas, T. Leimkühler, and G. Drettakis, “3D Gaussian Splatting for Real-Time Radiance Field Rendering,” ACM Trans. Graph., vol. 42, no. 4, 2023.',
      '[2]', 'N. Keetha, J. Karhade, K. M. Jatavallabhula, et al., “SplaTAM: Splat, Track & Map 3D Gaussians for Dense RGB-D SLAM,” in Proc. IEEE/CVF CVPR, 2024.',
      '[3]', 'H. Matsuki, R. Murai, P. H. J. Kelly, and A. J. Davison, “Gaussian Splatting SLAM,” in Proc. IEEE/CVF CVPR, 2024.',
      '[4]', 'C. Campos, R. Elvira, J. J. G. Rodríguez, et al., “ORB-SLAM3: An Accurate Open-Source Library for Visual, Visual–Inertial and Multi-Map SLAM,” IEEE Trans. Robot., vol. 37, no. 6, 2021.',
      '[5]', 'B. Bescos, J. M. Fácil, J. Civera, and J. Neira, “DynaSLAM: Tracking, Mapping and Inpainting in Dynamic Scenes,” IEEE Robot. Autom. Lett., vol. 3, no. 4, 2018.',
      '[6]', 'C. Yu, Z. Liu, X. Liu, et al., “DS-SLAM: A Semantic Visual SLAM towards Dynamic Environments,” in Proc. IEEE/RSJ IROS, 2018.',
      '[7]', 'Z. Teed and J. Deng, “RAFT: Recurrent All-Pairs Field Transforms for Optical Flow,” in Proc. ECCV, 2020.',
      '[8]', 'L. Piccinelli, Y.-H. Yang, C. Sakaridis, et al., “UniDepth: Universal Monocular Metric Depth Estimation,” in Proc. IEEE/CVF CVPR, 2024.',
      '[9]', 'K. M. Jatavallabhula, A. Kuwajerwala, Q. Gu, et al., “ConceptFusion: Open-set Multimodal 3D Mapping,” in Proc. RSS, 2023.',
      '[10]', 'M. Ye, M. Danelljan, F. Yu, and L. Ke, “Gaussian Grouping: Segment and Edit Anything in 3D Scenes,” in Proc. ECCV, 2024.',
      '[11]', '“NavArena: Automated Construction of Goal-Oriented Navigation Benchmarks from 3D Gaussian Splatting Reconstructions,” arXiv:2609.04602, 2026.　[12]　“SuperMap: A Spatio-Temporal SLAM System for Visual-Language Navigation,” arXiv:2608.22896, 2026.',
    ].reduce((acc, v, i) => {
      if (i % 2 === 0) acc.push([v]);
      else acc[acc.length - 1].push(v);
      return acc;
    }, []).map((it, i) => (
      <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', height: 46, borderBottom: i < 10 ? '1px solid #EDF1F7' : 'none' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 36 }}>{it[0]}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568', width: 1124, lineHeight: 1.45 }}>{it[1]}</Text>
      </Box>
    ))}

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 'auto', padding: '8px 20px', background: '#F7F9FC', borderLeft: '3px solid #3D7BD9', height: 46 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>
        [1]—[8] 为各支柱的奠基性工作；[11][12] 为近一年内与本课题直接相关的导航与时空建图工作。另有 <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>2025-11 至 2026-11 系统检索的 100 篇</span>已全部入库（Zotero 标签 毕业论文参考文献100_2025-11至2026-11），完整清单随论文附录提交。
      </Text>
    </Box>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 50, paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, paddingTop: 10, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
